OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball boom comes to city with
OL,4,Amajor new venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pickleball company is developing a
OL,7,Fvenue in Stoke-on-Trent which it says
OL,8,Fwill be one of the UK's largest
OL,9,Fdedicated to the sport.
OL,11,FA mix of tennis, badminton and
OL,12,Fping-pong, the game can be played by
OL,13,Fsingles or in pairs, indoors or
OL,14,Foutdoors.
