OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball boom comes to city with
OL,4,Amajor new venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPickleball People, who sell pickleball
OL,7,Fproducts and run play and coaching
OL,8,Fsessions at leisure centres in
OL,9,FStaffordshire, Shropshire and Cheshire,
OL,10,Fplan to convert a warehouse and offices
OL,11,Fat Festival Park into a nine court
OL,12,Fsite, cafe bar, shop and viewing areas,
OL,13,Fdue to open next year.
OL,15,FDirector Rob Taylor said: "We bought
OL,16,Fthe building at the beginning of
OL,17,FAugust...[but] we've being working on
OL,18,Fthis project for the best part of two
OL,19,Fyears."
